+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Command line
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar &lt;command&gt; &lt;options&gt;
+
+Commands (use `<command> -help` for the options of a command):
+
+* `init`: creates a new analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports`: generates the reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or refreshes a landscape report (in `<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape`), aggregating the results of multiple analyses; the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands
+* `updateLandscape`: the same command as `analyzeLandscape` (the older name, kept for existing scripts)
+* `updateConfig`: updates an analysis configuration file and completes missing fields
+* `extractGitHistory`, `extractGitSubHistory`, `extractFiles`: utility commands for git history and file extraction
+* `createConventionsFile`, `exportStandardConventions`: conventions file utilities
\ No newline at end of file
